  "_comment": "Maps each ASVS 5.0 chapter to the primary verification MECHANISM and the deterministic tools (from ../../../types.md) that can PRODUCE evidence for it. mechanism=tool means a scanner output is the proof; mechanism=inspection means LLM/human review of code/design; mechanism=hybrid means run the tool AND reason about what it cannot reach (business logic, authz intent). Prefer tool evidence wherever a mapping exists — that is what makes the verdict provable rather than an opinion.",
